   "id": "n36",
   "text": "And honestly a lot of bosses get paid in shares too. So when the share price goes up their bonus goes up. Guess who they're working for.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "smug",
   "pose": "shrug",
   "pic": {
    "id": "ceo",
    "at": "bosses",
    "look": "tape"
   },
   "zoom": {
    "in": "Guess",
    "out": "for"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "cash",
     "at": "shares"
    },
    {
     "s": "boom",
     "at": "for"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c2k",
   "text": "So when a company makes a big profit it often buys back its own shares. That pushes the price up for the owners. Your raise? Maybe next year.",
   "pic": {
    "id": "shares",
    "at": "shares",
    "look": "sticker"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "cash",
     "at": "profit"
    },
    {
     "s": "pack/01_evolve_brassy_swell",
     "at": "owners"
    },
    {
     "s": "cricket",
     "at": "year"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n11",
   "text": "That's the moment hard work stopped making people rich. Not because work got easier. Because the reward for work stopped growing.",
   "card": {
    "t": "The reward stopped growing.",
    "dark": true
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "pack/01_boom",
     "at": "growing"
    }
   ],
   "pause": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "c3a",
   "text": "And here's the part that kept me awake. Money itself got a better deal than people.",
   "chapter": "Money Works Harder Than You",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "worried",
   "pose": "talk",
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "pack/01_beating",
     "at": "awake"
    },
    {
     "s": "sting",
     "at": "people"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c3b",
   "text": "Think about my landlord again. I work all month. Half my paycheck goes to him. He does nothing. And every year his building is worth more.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "angry",
   "pose": "point_r",
   "pic": {
    "id": "apartment",
    "at": "building",
    "look": "tape"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "tick",
     "at": "month"
    },
    {
     "s": "cash",
     "at": "Half"
    },
    {
     "s": "cricket",
     "at": "nothing"
    },
    {
     "s": "ding",
     "at": "more"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n12",
   "text": "My landlord on the first of the month.",
   "meme": {
    "t": "stonks",
    "a": "PASSIVE INCOME",
    "at": "landlord"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "cash",
     "at": "landlord"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c3c",
   "text": "The people who owned stocks and buildings and businesses watched their stuff grow way faster than any paycheck. While they slept.",
   "pic": {
    "id": "skyline",
    "at": "slept",
    "look": "polaroid"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "ding",
     "at": "stocks"
    },
    {
     "s": "pack/01_evolve_brassy_swell",
     "at": "faster"
    },
    {
     "s": "boing",
     "at": "slept"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n37",
   "text": "Since grandpa's time the stock market grew way faster than paychecks. Way faster. If you owned a piece of it you were pulled up. If you didn't you just watched.",
   "pic": {
    "id": "rocket",
    "at": "faster",
    "look": "polaroid"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "pack/03_evolve_boom_brass_d",
     "at": "faster"
    },
    {
     "s": "cricket",
     "at": "watched"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c3d",
   "text": "There are two kinds of money. Money you earn with your body. And money your money earns. The first one gets tired. The second one never sleeps.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "smug",
   "pose": "point_up",
   "slam": {
    "t": "MONEY NEVER SLEEPS",
    "at": "never"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "ding",
     "at": "two"
    },
    {
     "s": "thud",
     "at": "body"
    },
    {
     "s": "boom",
     "at": "sleeps"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n13",
   "text": "You can only work twenty four hours a day. Trust me I've tried. But money can work in a thousand places at once.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "tired",
   "pose": "shrug",
   "pic": {
    "id": "clock",
    "at": "hours",
    "look": "circle"
   },
   "zoom": {
    "in": "thousand",
    "out": "once"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "tick",
     "at": "hours"
    },
    {
     "s": "boing",
     "at": "tried"
    },
    {
     "s": "boom",
     "at": "once"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n38",
   "text": "My landlord made more money this year by doing nothing than I made by delivering four hundred tacos. I counted. It was four hundred and twelve.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "tired",
   "pose": "facepalm",
   "pic": {
    "id": "tacos",
    "at": "tacos",
    "look": "sticker"
   },
   "slam": {
    "t": "412 TACOS",
    "at": "twelve"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "cash",
     "at": "money"
    },
    {
     "s": "pop",
     "at": "tacos"
    },
    {
     "s": "boom",
     "at": "twelve"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c3e",
   "text": "It's like a race where you run on your legs and the other guy rides an escalator that keeps getting faster. You can run harder. You won't catch him.",
   "pic": {
    "id": "escalator",
    "at": "escalator",
    "look": "tape"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "step",
     "at": "run"
    },
    {
     "s": "whoosh",
     "at": "escalator"
    },
    {
     "s": "trombone",
     "at": "him"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n39",
   "text": "And the worst part? The escalator guy isn't smarter than you. He's not working harder than you. He just got on earlier.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "angry",
   "pose": "point_r",
   "zoom": {
    "in": "got",
    "out": "earlier"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "scratch",
     "at": "smarter"
    },
    {
     "s": "boom",
     "at": "earlier"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n14",
   "text": "Me running after the escalator guy.",
   "meme": {
    "t": "vs",
    "a": "My overtime",
    "b": "His stocks while he naps",
    "at": "running"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "whoosh",
     "at": "running"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c3f",
   "text": "And the gap feeds itself. The more you own the more you earn. The more you earn the more you buy. That's why it feels like the rich get richer on autopilot.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "suspicious",
   "pose": "hips",
   "pic": {
    "id": "snowball",
    "at": "autopilot",
    "look": "circle"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "ding",
     "at": "own"
    },
    {
     "s": "cash",
     "at": "earn"
    },
    {
     "s": "pack/01_evolve_brassy_swell",
     "at": "autopilot"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n15",
   "text": "Like a snowball. Small at the top of the hill. A monster at the bottom. And you're standing at the bottom with a spoon.",
   "pic": {
    "id": "spoon",
    "at": "spoon",
    "look": "sticker"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "whoosh",
     "at": "snowball"
    },
    {
     "s": "pack/03_evolve_boom_brass_d",
     "at": "monster"
    },
    {
     "s": "boing",
     "at": "spoon"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n40",
   "text": "That's why the gap between owners and workers isn't just a gap. It's a gap that grows every single night while you sleep.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "worried",
   "pose": "talk",
   "pic": {
    "id": "moon",
    "at": "night",
    "look": "circle"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "pack/01_beating",
     "at": "grows"
    },
    {
     "s": "sting",
     "at": "sleep"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c3g",
   "text": "Remember the billionaire video? Same idea. They don't get rich from salary. They get rich from owning things.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "smug",
   "pose": "point_r",
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "ding",
     "at": "billionaire"
    },
    {
     "s": "stamp",
     "at": "owning"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c3h",
   "text": "And here's the sad twist. Grandpa owned a house. That house quietly made him richer than his job ever did. He thought it was hard work. It was owning.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "shock",
   "pose": "panic",
   "slam": {
    "t": "IT WAS OWNING",
    "at": "owning"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "drumroll",
     "at": "twist"
    },
    {
     "s": "pack/01_boom",
     "at": "owning"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n16",
   "text": "Grandpa finding out his house did more work than him.",
   "meme": {
    "t": "fine",
    "a": "Forty years of overtime",
    "at": "house"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "cricket",
     "at": "house"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c3i",
   "text": "So the lesson wasn't work hard. The lesson was work hard and own something. Grandpa just never said the second part out loud.",
   "card": {
    "t": "Work hard AND own something.",
    "dark": true
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "pack/01_boom",
     "at": "own"
    }
   ],
   "pause": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "n17",
   "text": "Be honest. Has anyone in your family ever said the word investing at dinner? Mine said pass the potatoes and stop asking questions.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "grin",
   "pose": "point_r",
   "pic": {
    "id": "potatoes",
    "at": "potatoes",
    "look": "sticker"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "ding",
     "at": "investing"
    },
    {
     "s": "boing",
     "at": "potatoes"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c3j",
   "text": "And that's not an accident. When you're tired from two jobs you don't have time to learn how money works. Tired people don't ask questions.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "suspicious",
   "pose": "talk",
   "zoom": {
    "in": "Tired",
    "out": "questions"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "pack/01_beating",
     "at": "tired"
    },
    {
     "s": "boom",
     "at": "questions"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n41",
   "text": "Nobody sat you down and explained this. School taught you how to be a good worker. Show up on time. Raise your hand. Nobody taught you how to be an owner.",
   "pic": {
    "id": "classroom",
    "at": "School",
    "look": "tape"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "ding",
     "at": "School"
    },
    {
     "s": "tick",
     "at": "time"
    },
    {
     "s": "stamp",
     "at": "owner"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n42",
   "text": "School teaching us to be good employees.",
   "meme": {
    "t": "drake",
    "a": "How to own a business",
    "b": "How to raise your hand to pee",
    "at": "employees"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "pop",
     "at": "employees"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c4a",
   "text": "So what's the switch? How do you get on the escalator? Quick reminder this is education and not advice.",
   "chapter": "Switching Sides",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "happy",
   "pose": "point_up",
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "click",
     "at": "switch"
    },
    {
     "s": "ding",
     "at": "escalator"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c4b",
   "text": "The switch is simple. Stop being only a worker. Become an owner. Even a tiny one.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "smug",
   "pose": "present",
   "slam": {
    "t": "BECOME AN OWNER",
    "at": "owner"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "click",
     "at": "switch"
    },
    {
     "s": "pack/03_evolve_boom_brass_d",
     "at": "owner"
    },
    {
     "s": "pop",
     "at": "tiny"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n18",
   "text": "No I don't mean buy a building. I can't even buy a couch without a payment plan.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "grin",
   "pose": "shrug",
   "pic": {
    "id": "couch",
    "at": "couch",
    "look": "tape"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "scratch",
     "at": "building"
    },
    {
     "s": "boing",
     "at": "couch"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c4c",
   "text": "One. An index fund is a little piece of hundreds of companies at once. The same companies that kept the extra cookies. Now some of the cookies come back to you.",
   "pic": {
    "id": "index",
    "at": "index",
    "look": "tape"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "ding",
     "at": "One"
    },
    {
     "s": "cash",
     "at": "companies"
    },
    {
     "s": "pop",
     "at": "cookies#2"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n43",
   "text": "Think about it. When those companies make record profits a little of that record comes to you. You're not just the worker anymore. You're also the shareholder they're working for.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "grin",
   "pose": "present",
   "slam": {
    "t": "YOU'RE THE SHAREHOLDER",
    "at": "shareholder"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "ding",
     "at": "record"
    },
    {
     "s": "pack/01_evolve_brassy_swell",
     "at": "shareholder"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n19",
   "text": "Me buying my first tiny slice of every company in the country.",
   "meme": {
    "t": "stonks",
    "a": "PART OWNER OF EVERYTHING",
    "at": "slice"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "pack/01_evolve_brassy_swell",
     "at": "slice"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c4d",
   "text": "Two. If your job matches what you save for retirement take it. That's your boss handing you a piece of the escalator for free. Most people leave it on the table.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "shock",
   "pose": "point_r",
   "pic": {
    "id": "handshake",
    "at": "boss",
    "look": "circle"
   },
   "zoom": {
    "in": "free",
    "out": "table"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "ding",
     "at": "Two"
    },
    {
     "s": "cash",
     "at": "free"
    },
    {
     "s": "boom",
     "at": "table"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n20",
   "text": "People skipping the free match.",
   "meme": {
    "t": "buttons",
    "a": "Free money from my boss",
    "b": "Thirty more dollars this month",
    "at": "match"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "pack/01_beating",
     "at": "match"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c4e",
   "text": "Three. Start stupidly small. Ten dollars. Twenty. The amount doesn't matter at first. Being on the escalator matters.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "happy",
   "pose": "thumbs",
   "pic": {
    "id": "coins",
    "at": "Ten",
    "look": "sticker"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "coin",
     "at": "Ten"
    },
    {
     "s": "coin",
     "at": "Twenty"
    },
    {
     "s": "ding",
     "at": "escalator"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c4f",
   "text": "Four. Own your skills too. A skill nobody else has is like a little building inside your head. You can rent it out forever.",
   "pic": {
    "id": "tools",
    "at": "skills",
    "look": "tape"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "ding",
     "at": "skills"
    },
    {
     "s": "pack/01_processing",
     "at": "head"
    },
    {
     "s": "cash",
     "at": "forever"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n44",
   "text": "My friend learned to fix air conditioners. Now in summer people beg him to come over. He sets the price. That's what owning a skill feels like.",
   "pic": {
    "id": "aircon",
    "at": "conditioners",
    "look": "tape"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "ding",
     "at": "fix"
    },
    {
     "s": "crowd",
     "at": "beg"
    },
    {
     "s": "cash",
     "at": "price"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c4g",
   "text": "And five. Time is your secret weapon. Money you put in at twenty five works for forty years. Every year you wait the escalator gets harder to catch.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "suspicious",
   "pose": "point_up",
   "pic": {
    "id": "hourglass",
    "at": "Time",
    "look": "circle"
   },
   "slam": {
    "t": "TIME IS THE WEAPON",
    "at": "weapon"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "tick",
     "at": "Time"
    },
    {
     "s": "boom",
     "at": "weapon"
    },
    {
     "s": "whoosh",
     "at": "escalator"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n21",
   "text": "Me at twenty five versus me at forty five.",
   "meme": {
    "t": "drake",
    "a": "Starting later",
    "b": "Starting tiny today",
    "at": "versus"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "pop",
     "at": "versus"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c4h",
   "text": "It won't feel like much at first. A few dollars growing slowly. But remember the snowball. It starts tiny. That's not a bug. That's how every snowball starts.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "happy",
   "pose": "present",
   "pic": {
    "id": "snowman",
    "at": "snowball",
    "look": "sticker"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "ding",
     "at": "few"
    },
    {
     "s": "whoosh",
     "at": "snowball"
    },
    {
     "s": "boom",
     "at": "starts#2"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n45",
   "text": "And skip the get rich fast stuff. Remember the gurus. The escalator is slow and boring. Boring is the point.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "smug",
   "pose": "hips",
   "pic": {
    "id": "snail",
    "at": "slow",
    "look": "sticker"
   },
   "zoom": {
    "in": "Boring#2",
    "out": "point"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "scratch",
     "at": "fast"
    },
    {
     "s": "boing",
     "at": "slow"
    },
    {
     "s": "boom",
     "at": "point"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "n46",
   "text": "My investments growing at the speed of a snail.",
   "meme": {
    "t": "fine",
    "a": "Up four dollars this year",
    "at": "investments"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "cricket",
     "at": "investments"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "r1",
   "text": "So did hard work stop making people rich? Kind of. Hard work alone stopped. The reward moved from the people who work to the people who own.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "smug",
   "pose": "point_up",
   "zoom": {
    "in": "who",
    "out": "own"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "s": "drumroll",
     "at": "stop"
    },
    {
     "s": "pack/01_boom",
     "at": "own"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "r2",
   "text": "Grandpa's advice wasn't wrong. It was just missing a sentence. Work hard. Then make your money work too.",
   "host": true,
   "mood": "happy",
   "pose": "thumbs",
   "slam": {
    "t": "MAKE YOUR MONEY WORK",
    "at": "money"
